      "type": "question",
      "label": "3",
      "prompt": "A number is chosen at random from the first 30 positive whole numbers. What is the probability that it is not divisible by 7?",
      "answerSpaceMm": 30,
      "answer": {
        "short": "$\\frac{13}{15}$",
        "worked": "The numbers divisible by 7 are $7,14,21,28$.\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{not divisible by }7)&=1-\\frac{4}{30}\\\\P(\\text{not divisible by }7)&=\\frac{26}{30}\\\\P(\\text{not divisible by }7)&=\\frac{13}{15}\\end{align*}$$",
        "provenance": {
